WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,020
The target is Gu Shiyi

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:03,020
Could it be the Song family?

3
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:17,900
Go like this

4
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,900
Then let's die together

5
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:25,370
Sailin Okinawa

6
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:29,610
The pulse has just been sealed

7
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:31,610
torn

8
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:33,830
How can it still be

9
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:36,020
There's no need for a dead person to know so much

10
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,080
As expected of a seventeen year old

11
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:41,080
Seventh grade warrior

12
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:43,080
I lost unjustly

13
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:52,820
I'll just say

14
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:55,020
How can you not even defeat a stylized tiger?

15
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:56,020
Turns out it was just an act

16
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,020
Don’t pretend this time

17
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:59,020
You don’t even know your true level

18
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:00,020
You are training me

19
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:02,020
So how did I perform this time?

20
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:03,020
Somewhat useful

21
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:12,920
At least it won't hold me back in the future.

22
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:13,920
Making such a big fuss

23
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,920
Why didn't the Liu family react at all?
